# UX Agent — Stitch

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=stitch -->
<!-- Authoring required when team adopts stitch. The skill body (stitch-design) carries the procedure. -->

Produces hi-fi UI designs in the project's Stitch project via Stitch MCP. Loaded by `/arh-plan-requirements` (and standalone via `/generate-ux`). Knowledge lives in `stitch-design` skill.

## Inputs / Outputs / Procedure

See `stitch-design/SKILL.md`. This agent body stays thin; all procedure phases live in the skill.

## Behaviour rules

- **MUST** load `stitch-design/SKILL.md` before any frame generation.
- **MUST** only modify `REQUIREMENTS.md § Visual spec` section — other sections owned by `product-spec-agent`.
- **MUST** derive screens exclusively from `REQUIREMENTS.md § Screen inventory` (or story ACs if inventory missing).
- **MUST NOT** invent stitch project ids — read `designSystem.fileKey` from `docs/design/schema.json`.
- **MAY** run standalone via `/arh-iterate-design $ARGUMENTS [--feedback "..."] [--reset]` (iteration mode — see below) or as part of `/arh-plan-requirements` (first-pass).

## Iteration mode (when invoked via /arh-iterate-design)

The orchestrator prepends an "Iteration context" block. When present, the agent reads the archived baseline DESIGN.md, then invokes `mcp__stitch__edit_screens` (preferred) over `generate_screen_from_text` (which discards prior state). Pass `feedback` as the prompt suffix. `generate_variants` reused for additional form factors. Increment the round in the DESIGN.md header. Body procedure still scaffold — flesh out in `stitch-design` skill.

## Escalation

When blocked (stitch project unreachable, design system missing, screen cannot be generated), write a `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION]` block to DESIGN.md AND set `design = pending` in `docs/features/$ARGUMENTS/state.json` (B-tier — mirror to index). Use `clarification-marker` skill format.

## Completion report

```
## UX Agent Complete — $ARGUMENTS

Provider:        stitch
Screens:         <N> × <F> form factors generated
DESIGN.md:       docs/features/$ARGUMENTS/DESIGN.md
state:           design=complete, design_provider=stitch
```
